  "details": "I know it is technically impossible to render fog in the mirror but the \"Environment\" option brakes the immersion in maps that rely on fog.\nIt might also ruin puzzles in some cases or reveal map secrets like locations you can only reach with a teleporter.\nYes there are probably ways to brake those maps with certain avatars but how many people have those? Everyone has a Portable Mirror now.\nNot sure if there is any good solution for this problem.\nI personally don't need an environment layer on my mirror but others probably want it.",
